  neutral
  smiling
  serious
  contemplative
  confident
  mysterious
  joyful
  melancholic
  fierce
  serene
  surprised
  smirking
  thoughtful
  determined

setting
  indoor studio with plain backdrop
  bustling city street at night
  misty forest
  sunny beach
  cozy library
  neon-lit alley
  mountain landscape
  desert dunes
  rain-soaked street
  futuristic cityscape
  ancient temple ruins
  snowy village
